flowchart LR
    I[input bit<br/>当前输入] --> R0[reg0]
    R0 --> R1[reg1]
    R1 --> R2[reg2]
    R2 --> R3[reg3]
    R3 --> R4[reg4]
    R4 --> R5[reg5]
    R5 --> R6[reg6]
    R0 --> X0[XOR for 171<br/>第一路生成多项式]
    R1 --> X0
    R2 --> X0
    R3 --> X0
    R6 --> X0
    R0 --> X1[XOR for 133<br/>第二路生成多项式]
    R2 --> X1
    R3 --> X1
    R5 --> X1
    R6 --> X1
    X0 --> O0[encoded bit 0]
    X1 --> O1[encoded bit 1]
